From 83084ec43d8da92d77d093d4f60dd953f08550aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Cloud Agent <agent@cursor.sh>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 17:17:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(memory): add personal category for user name, pet, and
 family names
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- New MemoryCategory 'personal' (weight=-1, highest priority)
- Extracts user name from '내 이름은 X야', 'X라고 불러' patterns
- Extracts pet names from 'X라는 강아지', '강아지 이름이 X야' patterns
- Extracts family names from '형 이름이 X야' etc.
- Personal facts appear in buildCommonContextBlock for every turn
- Profile nickname takes precedence over memory-extracted name
- 22/22 tests pass, tsc clean, lint clean
---
